### Liveness
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/healthz

###

### Readiness — requires the model artifact to have been trained and loaded
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/readyz

###

### Predict — exactly four finite numeric features
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "features": [0.2, -0.1, 1.3, 0.7]
}

###

### Prometheus metrics
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/metrics
